# OBOROZUKI MANOR 1F -- East Engawa (veranda)   (20x6, TILESET_TRADITIONAL_HOUSE, ref DanceTheater)
# A long wooden veranda: shoji rooms (2d) along the north wall, a tokonoma alcove with two scrolls,
# a garden fence (26) along the south and a strip of gravel garden with stepping-stone mats (3e/3f).
# Gameplay: trainer gauntlet. Two Kimono Girl apprentices watch the corridor, a Sage guards the
# tatami nook with the stairs down to the sunken Dojo. Gravel strip is a dead-end with a hidden item.
# No garden/tree blocks exist in this tileset: the "garden" is gravel (48) behind a fence.
# Warps: GENKAN stone mats (5,11)(6,11) -> Genkan east carpet. DANCE carpet (39,6)(39,7) -> Kagura
# Hall mats. DOJO stairs 1e (37,5) -> Dojo stairs 39 (1,2).
tileset traditional_house
ref DanceTheater
